WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
09:00 — Campus phone. Ahmed opens Campus on his phone in Roman Urdu — trading basics without fake tips or English-only gatekeeping.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
14:00 — Practice iPad. iPad practice lab in the afternoon; he tries a scenario, logs the attempt, leaves ego outside the room.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
20:00 — Records laptop. Laptop records show what he finished — education, not a brokerage pitch dressed as a lesson.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:40 — School of money. School of Money module on the laptop stays calm and factual; he notes questions for a human mentor later.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:00 — Phone recap. Phone Today recap before sleep. Roman Urdu first. Hustle culture never.

